      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1787560484601,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "2- inside use-reveal-active-file.ts will do:\n\n    - get -> activeTabId from useEditorStore()\n    - initate the revealFolders() function\n    - call the path Api -> to get the paths (ancestorFolderIds) for the active file to the root path\n",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "2- inside use-reveal-active-file.ts will do:\n\n    - get -> activeTabId from useEditorStore()\n    - initate the revealFolders() function\n    - call the path Api -> to get the paths (ancestorFolderIds) for the active file to the root path\n",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "UnGuV85qK1iVOFbq3PPSR",
