      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "1- expandedFolders - changes by\n\n    - toggleFolder()\n    - revealFolders()\n    - collapseAllFolders()",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "1- expandedFolders - changes by\n\n    - toggleFolder()\n    - revealFolders()\n    - collapseAllFolders()",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "5cBa8kiAsCjrMEmXcw-GA",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 338.95359210186825,
      "y": 3580.6733281429383,
      "width": 763.2395629882812,
      "height": 100,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 2,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "ag",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 925014574,
      "version": 16,
      "versionNonce": 1763958894,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1787561726901,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "1- inside \"file-explorer/index.tsx\":\n\n    - Mount the hook: useRevealActiveFile(projectId) at the file explorer level.\n    - Ensures the root header and tree listen to store changes for expansion.",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "1- inside \"file-explorer/index.tsx\":\n\n    - Mount the hook: useRevealActiveFile(projectId) at the file explorer level.\n    - Ensures the root header and tree listen to store changes for expansion.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "CraIazHSFX7-g6n6ITOIz",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 342.7035615842901,
      "y": 3730.423427325067,
      "width": 1020.4593505859375,
      "height": 250,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 2,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "ah",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 2142691694,
      "version": 110,
      "versionNonce": 1348402670,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1787561827524,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "2- inside \"file-explorer/tree.tsx\":\n\n    - Subscribe to store: isOpen = useEditorStore(state => state.isFolderExpanded(projectId, item._id))\n      to read expansion dynamically.\n\n    - Auto-scroll: Uses useEffect watching activeTabId and triggers \n      rowRef.current?.scrollIntoView({ block: \"nearest\" }) when the file matches.\n\n    - Lazy loading: Renders sub-items recursively using useFolderContents \n      when isOpen becomes true via the reveal flow.",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "2- inside \"file-explorer/tree.tsx\":\n\n    - Subscribe to store: isOpen = useEditorStore(state => state.isFolderExpanded(projectId, item._id))\n      to read expansion dynamically.\n\n    - Auto-scroll: Uses useEffect watching activeTabId and triggers \n      rowRef.current?.scrollIntoView({ block: \"nearest\" }) when the file matches.\n\n    - Lazy loading: Renders sub-items recursively using useFolderContents \n      when isOpen becomes true via the reveal flow.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "VW-OxxzZ-TxN2kK2oGpA8",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 349.20353869610653,
      "y": 4042.9234082515813,
      "width": 924.41943359375,
      "height": 175,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 2,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "ai",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1204116654,
      "version": 215,
      "versionNonce": 125823026,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1787561928153,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "3- inside \"file-explorer/tree-item-wrapper.tsx\":\n\n    - Forward Ref: Accepts ref (React.Ref<HTMLButtonElement>) \n      to pass it directly down to the row <button>.\n\n    - Context & Interaction: Handles clicks, double-clicks, \n      and context menus while exposing the DOM node needed for the scroll-into-view behavior.",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "3- inside \"file-explorer/tree-item-wrapper.tsx\":\n\n    - Forward Ref: Accepts ref (React.Ref<HTMLButtonElement>) \n      to pass it directly down to the row <button>.\n\n    - Context & Interaction: Handles clicks, double-clicks, \n      and context menus while exposing the DOM node needed for the scroll-into-view behavior.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "7Nxrv7rwAlOqlValnK3t5",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 367.2273780108852,
      "y": 4448.5066246008655,
      "width": 1383.56640625,
      "height": 725,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 2,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "aj",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1064465522,
      "version": 93,
      "versionNonce": 79409458,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1787563425147,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "[ 1. User Action: Click Tab ]\n  │  File: src/features/editor/components/top-navigation.tsx\n  ├─► <Tab onClick={() => { setActiveTab(fileId); }} />\n  └─► Updates activeTabId in Zustand Store\n       │\n       ▼\n[ 2. The Trigger: useRevealActiveFile Hook ]\n  │  File: src/features/projects/hooks/use-reveal-active-file.ts\n  └─► Watches activeTabId changes automatically (mounted in FileExplorer)\n       │\n       ▼\n[ 3. Backend Path Resolution ]\n  │  File: useFilePath(activeTabId) -> Backend Query: getFilePath\n  └─► Walks upward: File ➔ Parent ➔ Ancestors ➔ Root (Returns ancestorFolderIds[])\n       │\n       ▼\n[ 4. Store Update & Cascade ]\n  │  File: src/features/editor/store/use-editor-store.ts\n  └─► revealFolders(projectId, ancestorFolderIds) -> Unions ids into expandedFolders Set & opens root\n       │\n       ▼\n[ 5. Tree Component Lazy Loading ]\n  │  File: src/features/projects/components/tree.tsx\n  └─► isOpen becomes true ➔ useFolderContents fetches items recursively level by level ➔ [root, ancestor, parent, file.. ] \n       │\n       ▼\n[ 6. Final UI Scroll to View ]\n  │  File: src/features/projects/components/tree-item-wrapper.tsx\n  └─► rowRef.current?.scrollIntoView({ block: \"nearest\" }) ",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "[ 1. User Action: Click Tab ]\n  │  File: src/features/editor/components/top-navigation.tsx\n  ├─► <Tab onClick={() => { setActiveTab(fileId); }} />\n  └─► Updates activeTabId in Zustand Store\n       │\n       ▼\n[ 2. The Trigger: useRevealActiveFile Hook ]\n  │  File: src/features/projects/hooks/use-reveal-active-file.ts\n  └─► Watches activeTabId changes automatically (mounted in FileExplorer)\n       │\n       ▼\n[ 3. Backend Path Resolution ]\n  │  File: useFilePath(activeTabId) -> Backend Query: getFilePath\n  └─► Walks upward: File ➔ Parent ➔ Ancestors ➔ Root (Returns ancestorFolderIds[])\n       │\n       ▼\n[ 4. Store Update & Cascade ]\n  │  File: src/features/editor/store/use-editor-store.ts\n  └─► revealFolders(projectId, ancestorFolderIds) -> Unions ids into expandedFolders Set & opens root\n       │\n       ▼\n[ 5. Tree Component Lazy Loading ]\n  │  File: src/features/projects/components/tree.tsx\n  └─► isOpen becomes true ➔ useFolderContents fetches items recursively level by level ➔ [root, ancestor, parent, file.. ] \n       │\n       ▼\n[ 6. Final UI Scroll to View ]\n  │  File: src/features/projects/components/tree-item-wrapper.tsx\n  └─► rowRef.current?.scrollIntoView({ block: \"nearest\" }) ",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
